ong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>9 large airports, each with multiple runway configurations<br></li><li>realistic plane behavior<br></li><li>adaptive, randomly generated traffic<br></li><li>pilot speech<br></li><li>easy to play, by mouse or keyboard</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALISM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>wind and storms<br></li><li>go-arounds<br></li><li>restricted areas<br></li><li>parallel approaches<br></li><li>occasional emergencies<br></li><li>secondary nearby airports<br></li><li>wake turbulence<br></li><li>delays<br></li><li>holdings</li></ul><br>Although the controls are relatively easy, this game may have a learning curve if you're unfamiliar with aviation. For example, this is how an ILS approach works:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666610/extras/daacf328074002edab53b02fb5f4fe68.poster.avif?t=1769635708\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666610/extras/daacf328074002edab53b02fb5f4fe68.webm?t=1769635708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666610/extras/daacf328074002edab53b02fb5f4fe68.mp4?t=1769635708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666610/extras/9f4fdeca40b000a9328a0e725ef6dee0.avif?t=1769635708\" width=608 height=348 /></span>",
